{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tools/a-tool-name-no-vendor-accepts-is-refused-when-the-tool-is-defined",
  "title": "A tool whose name is empty or holds a character other than a letter, a digit, _, ., : or - is refused when it is defined, the agent's registration with it",
  "rules": [
    "§6.7"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-6.7-094"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: providers/ai/base.py AITool (some_vendor_accepts_tool_name); roomkit-rs: roomkit-ai provider/tool_declaration.rs some_vendor_accepts_tool_name, AiTool::new. The last registration, of a name of every accepted kind, shows the refused ones left nothing registered. RK-6.7-094 is cited in part: that the name is refused as the tool is defined, rather than as the channel holding it is built, which refuses it too, is not told apart.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "register_channel",
      "channel": {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Hi."
            }
          ]
        },
        "tools": [
          {
            "name": "",
            "description": "Look it up.",
            "returns": "found"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "invalid_argument"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "register_channel",
      "channel": {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Hi."
            }
          ]
        },
        "tools": [
          {
            "name": "look up",
            "description": "Look it up.",
            "returns": "found"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "invalid_argument"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "register_channel",
      "channel": {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Hi."
            }
          ]
        },
        "tools": [
          {
            "name": "look/up",
            "description": "Look it up.",
            "returns": "found"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "invalid_argument"
      }
